        <mxCell id="c52" value="&lt;i&gt;The upper strip is to scale from 2024-01-01 to 2027-02-23; the lower strip enlarges 2026-12-01 to 2027-03-01. Payroll posts through 2026-12-18, 13 days before the last year-end, and the ledger runs 54 days past it with supplier payments alone, so a balance at the ledger&#x27;s last date is not a year-end balance. The data-through date is the last year-end itself, where the last pair of closes sits.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="426" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
